 "text": "Press Alt+1 for screen-reader mode, Alt+0 to cancel Accessibility Screen-Reader Guide, Feedback, and Issue Reporting | New window D3 Meet Us Services Our Work Blog Careers Contact Us REQUEST A QUOTE Meet Us Meet the Team Behind D3: Your Local Marketing Partners A Legacy of Innovation & Relationships Founded in 1995 by John Gehrig in Ocean City, Maryland, D3 has grown from a two‑person startup, spreading the word for businesses to get email addresses and websites, into a team of over 40 dedicated professionals across Ocean City and Salisbury, MD. Our core values—kindness, collaboration, and personal service—have guided us from day one. We believe in a human approach to marketing, where genuine connections and thoughtful strategy fuel outstanding results for all industries. Our Philosophy: Stay Curious, Stay Ahead We have been on the forefront of technology trends and the need for digital marketing. Through dial‑up modems, flip phones, and even encouraging email addresses on business cards, D3 has seen it all. But what truly drives our team is helping clients navigate digital evolution with confidence. Whether it’s SEO, social media trends, mobile apps, AI, or the next big thing, we promise to filter the hype from opportunity and guide you where it counts. Personalized Service with a Local Touch We pride ourselves on relationships, not transactions. That means face-to-face meetings, virtual chats, and phone calls (yes, we still love talking!). All this to ensure no detail slips through the cracks. Why Choose D3? What We Value: Local & National Expertise Comprehensive Marketing Collaborative Approach Future-First Thinking How We Deliver: 30 years serving businesses from Ocean City, MD, the East Coast, and beyond. From websites to print, multimedia, and more, we have everything you need in one place. We listen, strategize, brainstorm, and build together. Your success is our success! We vet technology and strategy, adopting only what’s effective for your growth. Let’s Get Started We would love to get to know you, your business, and your goals. Connect with our team today. Join the many businesses that have partnered with D3 to reach new heights together. Call us at 410‑213‑2400 or submit a quote request via our contact form. Subscribe Get the latest marketing news and advice. First Name Last Name Email SUBSCRIBE This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply. 12319 Ocean Gateway, Suite 202 Ocean City, Maryland 21842 410-213-2400 212 West Main Street Salisbury, Maryland 21801 Meet Us Testimonials Services Case Studies Videos ID3AS Blog Careers Contact Us Privacy Policy Terms & Conditions Webmail Accessibility Site Map Copyright © 2026 D3. All Rights Reserved. Website Design by D3, Ocean City MD Our Partners PREVIOUS Google YouTube Shopify Amazon Adobe Woocommerce Wordpress Bing Facebook Google YouTube Shopify Amazon Adobe Woocommerce Wordpress Bing Facebook Google NEXT",
